{"title":"“十五五”碳达峰实施路径进一步明晰","date":"2026-08-18","content":"<h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" id=\"activity-name\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 22px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space-collapse: collapse; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span class=\"js_title_inner\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px;\">&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;碳达峰实施路径进一步明晰</span></h1>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"71864\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 247, 238);border-radius:8px;padding:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background:linear-gradient(rgb(219, 43, 21), rgb(247, 148, 98));padding-left:4px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(254, 246, 236);padding:0px 15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 17px; text-indent: 2.11765em; text-align: justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"text-indent: 36px;\">6月29日，国务院总理李强主持召开国务院常务会议，审议通过《&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;碳达峰行动方案》（以下简称《行动方案》）。会议指出，要发挥碳达峰碳中和战略牵引作用，促进经济结构转型升级，打造更多绿色经济增长点。要聚焦重点领域、关键环节持续用力，加快能源结构调整优化，推进产业绿色化低碳化，健全完善法律法规标准、碳排放统计核算等体系，科学有序开展评价考核，将绿色低碳导向融入国民经济循环各领域各环节，推动形成绿色生产生活方式，厚植高质量发展绿色底色。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t二氧化碳排放力争于2030年前达到峰值是我国向世界作出的庄严承诺，也是实现高质量发展的内在要求。&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;是实现碳达峰目标的攻坚期、决胜期，此次会议审议通过《行动方案》，标志着我国&ldquo;十五五&rdquo;时期碳达峰工作的目标任务与实施路径进一步明晰。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-top: 10px; color: rgb(97, 35, 4); line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: 0px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202607/1-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:15px;\">图为位于山东省莱州市海域的海上风电项目。新华社</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\">从政策演进历程看，我国碳达峰工作经历了从理念到行动、从顶层设计到具体落实的发展过程。</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section data-id=\"170651\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:10px auto;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;z-index:3;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(to right, rgb(247, 148, 98), rgb(247, 148, 98));background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;padding:9px 20px 9px 30px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;background-clip:initial;-webkit-background-clip:initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align:center;margin-bottom:u